{"ticker":{"symbol":"163280.KQ","name":"에어레인","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":3800.0,"change_pct":0.014686248331108098,"market_cap":51691696128.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":9165.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Cheongju-si","employees":null,"website":"https://airrane.com","business_summary":"Airrane Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells gas separation membranes in South Korea and internationally. Its products include nitrogen generation, dehumidification, biogas upgrading, oxygen generation, and pervaporation and vapor permeation membrane products, as well as CO2 injection and bubbler, and CCUS and clean H2 products. The company serves oil and gas, energy, biogas, petrochemical, electronics, marine, aircraft, agriculture, and logistics industries. Airrane Co., Ltd. was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Cheongju-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)에어레인은 기체분리막을 국내는 물론 해외까지 제조, 판매하고 있는 회사입니다. 해당 제품에는 질소 생성, 제습, 바이오가스 업그레이드, 산소 생성, 투과기화 및 증기 투과 막 제품은 물론 CO2 주입 및 버블러, CCUS 및 청정 H2 제품이 포함됩니다. 이 회사는 석유 및 가스, 에너지, 바이오가스, 석유화학, 전자, 해양, 항공기, 농업 및 물류 산업에 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 에어레인(주)는 2001년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 청주시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":12938954960.0,"operating_income":1008112570.0,"net_income":-4618704550.0,"eps":-1086.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":16343932410.0,"operating_income":240058960.0,"net_income":-15060340870.0,"eps":-3168.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":24499902640.0,"operating_income":1871004240.0,"net_income":1976091470.0,"eps":168.5},{"period":"2025","revenue":28075652730.0,"operating_income":3088719860.0,"net_income":2800297210.0,"eps":206.0}],"price_history":[],"analyst":{"n_analysts":null,"rating"